      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUNAR LIL (1) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a neck (19.74) behind Crisis Averted at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Overdue and is among the main hopes. WEDGES (2) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at this track over 350m behind Panama King (20.17) in a Grade 6. Likely to be thereabouts. GO BLANCHETT GO (7) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 350m behind Pannonia (20.12) in a Grade 6. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Can do much better this time. SWIFT LADY LUNA (8) has definite claims at her first try at this journey.",
